*> Entity models part 7 section 2 (Blaze): the mesh (2.1), setupAnim (2.2), shadow, block light level and texture.
*> Entry points for the integrator (inputs; the table programs take IN (16 FLOAT-LONG) and OUT (64 FLOAT-LONG)):
*>   EF7-BLAZE-ANIM EMM-MODEL state(1 xRot, 2 yRot degrees, 3 ageInTicks): reset first, head look, the twelve rods on three rings; EF7-BLAZE-RENDER IN() OUT(shadow radius, block light level); EF7-BLAZE-TEXTURE IN() path(out X(120)).


 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. EF7-M-BLAZE.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 WS-ROWS.
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "P head root 0 0 0 0 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "C head 0 0 -4 -4 -4 8 8 8 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "P part0 root 9.0 -1.0 0.0 0 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "C part0 0 16 0 0 0 2 8 2 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "P part1 root -0.000000659 -1.122417438 9.0 0 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "C part1 0 16 0 0 0 2 8 2 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "P part2 root -9.0 -1.459697694 -0.000001318 0 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "C part2 0 16 0 0 0 2 8 2 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "P part3 root 0.000001977 -1.929262798 -9.0 0 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "C part3 0 16 0 0 0 2 8 2 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "P part4 root 4.949747287 1.583853163 4.949747649 0 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "C part4 0 16 0 0 0 2 8 2 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "P part5 root -4.949748012 1.198856384 4.949746925 0 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "C part5 0 16 0 0 0 2 8 2 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "P part6 root -4.949746562 1.010007503 -4.949748374 0 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "C part6 0 16 0 0 0 2 8 2 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "P part7 root 4.949748737 1.063543313 -4.9497462 0 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "C part7 0 16 0 0 0 2 8 2 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "P part8 root 4.455032526 11.960170287 2.269952686 0 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "C part8 0 16 0 0 0 2 8 2 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "P part9 root -2.269953012 11.893006345 4.45503236 0 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "C part9 0 16 0 0 0 2 8 2 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "P part10 root -4.455032193 11.346635318 -2.269953338 0 0 0".
